{"id": "real_auth_token_ttl", "category": "auth", "question": "Mercury Commerce Platform 的 access token 有效期是多少？", "reference_answer": "Mercury 平台使用 JWT access token，access_token 有效期为 30 分钟。", "expected_docs": ["api_auth.md"], "must_include": ["30 分钟"], "must_not_include": ["15 分钟"], "expected_behavior": {"should_rewrite": false, "should_multi_hop": false, "max_retrieval_rounds": 3, "expected_tools": ["search_dev_knowledge"], "forbidden_tools": []}}
{"id": "real_auth_refresh", "category": "auth", "question": "refresh token 的有效期是多久，过期后如何获取新的 access token？", "reference_answer": "refresh token 有效期为 7 天；过期后通过 POST /auth/refresh 携带 refresh_token 换取新的 access token，且刷新令牌会轮换。", "expected_docs": ["api_auth.md"], "must_include": ["7 天", "POST /auth/refresh"], "must_not_include": ["24 小时"], "expected_behavior": {"should_rewrite": false, "should_multi_hop": false, "max_retrieval_rounds": 3, "expected_tools": ["search_dev_knowledge"], "forbidden_tools": []}}
{"id": "real_auth_scope_403", "category": "auth", "question": "在 Mercury 平台，access token 有效但 scope 不足时返回什么状态码？", "reference_answer": "token 有效但 scope 不足时返回 403（权限不足）。", "expected_docs": ["api_auth.md"], "must_include": ["403"], "must_not_include": ["401"], "expected_behavior": {"should_rewrite": false, "should_multi_hop": false, "max_retrieval_rounds": 3, "expected_tools": ["search_dev_knowledge"], "forbidden_tools": []}}
{"id": "real_deploy_bluegreen", "category": "deploy", "question": "Mercury Commerce Platform 的 Order Service 采用什么部署方式？", "reference_answer": "Order Service (mercury-order) 采用 blue-green 部署。", "expected_docs": ["deployment.md"], "must_include": ["blue-green"], "must_not_include": ["滚动部署"], "expected_behavior": {"should_rewrite": false, "should_multi_hop": false, "max_retrieval_rounds": 3, "expected_tools": ["search_dev_knowledge"], "forbidden_tools": []}}
