{"id": "real_arch_components", "category": "arch", "question": "Mercury Commerce Platform 主要由哪些组件组成？", "reference_answer": "主要由 API Gateway (mercury-gateway)、Auth Service (mercury-auth)、Order Service (mercury-order)、Database (mercury-db)、Cache (mercury-cache)、Queue (mercury-queue) 组成。", "expected_docs": ["service_overview.md"], "must_include": ["mercury-gateway", "mercury-auth", "mercury-order"], "must_not_include": ["库存服务"], "expected_behavior": {"should_rewrite": false, "should_multi_hop": false, "max_retrieval_rounds": 3, "expected_tools": ["search_dev_knowledge"], "forbidden_tools": []}}
